    <item>
      <title>code-modernization: a rule is tested only if a test that ran backs it</title>
      <link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/commit/d49ccb3844876e35262a32f145b7b717646da733</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d49ccb3</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:28:44 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>gh-commits-plugins-official</category>
      <description>A rule named only by a skipped or pending test no longer counts as covered. It is listed as &quot;named, not run&quot; and fails the rules check. A test-only folder is listed as tooling and gets no verdict. The verify command tries malformed records only when the person asked for exact behavior, so a proof lo</description>
    </item>
